---
Title: Bourbon Pork Marinade
Servings: 1 servings
Tags: Prospects, American, Sauce
Link: https://www.themanual.com/food-and-drink/marinades-for-beef-pork-chicken-seafood-veggies/
---

Whisk or blend @Bourbon{1 cup}, @Brown Sugar{1/2 cup}, @Soy Sauce{1/4 cup}, @Worcestershire Sauce{1 Tablespoon}, chopped @Rosemary{1/2 Tablespoon}, @Black Pepper{1 teaspoon} together until fully incorporated.

Marinate pork for up to four hours.